This repository uses `lehard/dev-platform` for the shared agent/OpenSpec/worktree/merge/check/friction workflow.

Project/domain documentation belongs in this repository; the central platform owns only reusable development process.

## First check

```bash
python3 scripts/platform_doctor.py
```

## Working on a change

For non-trivial product or architecture work, create/update the OpenSpec change first.

Start isolated work with:

```bash
python3 scripts/start_worktree.py my-change --task "OpenSpec my-change: task range" --scope "path/or/module"
```

Inside the worktree, run selected checks before completion:

```bash
python3 scripts/select_checks.py
python3 scripts/select_checks.py --execute
```

Merge only through:

```bash
python3 scripts/merge_to_main.py
```

See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/engineering/`.
